    "show_share": true,
    "description": "His Excellency Right Honourable Donald C. McKinnon, the Secretary-General of the Commonwealth, will be the guest speaker at Aga Khan University (AKU) on Friday, February 17, 2006, where he will deliver a lecture titled 'Shaping the Global Agenda: The Role of the Commonwealth'.",
